    ],
    "text": "Corrigenda THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (Chapter 460) Notice under Section 7 My No.: KES/DS/LND/ACI/SAMURDI BANK. Ref. No. of the Ministry of Lands: 4-3/2/2017/S/525. I hereby notify that the Notice under Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, published by me in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2403/74 dated 28.09.2024 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka has been amended as follows. Public Purpose : Acquisition of lands for the construction of Samurdhi Community Based Bank, Madapatha.",
